***************************************************************************************************
***************************************************************************************************
* SSCS-Chipathon 2026, Team A38: The Silent Owl
* Derived from: extracted_gf180mcu_fd_io__asig_5p0_manually_scaled.spice (Ahmed M. Elnaggar)
***************************************************************************************************
* Why this file exists:
*
* 1) Pin order: the gf180mcu_fd_io__asig_5p0.sym symbol (xschem/gf180mcu_fd_io__asig_5p0.sym) orders
*    its pins by "pinnumber" as ASIG5V(1) DVDD(2) DVSS(3) VDD(4) VSS(5). Testbenches generated from
*    that symbol instantiate the pad in that order (e.g. "x2 rf_in_pad vddio GND vddio GND
*    gf180mcu_fd_io__asig_5p0"). The source file's .SUBCKT line used DVDD ASIG5V DVSS VDD VSS instead
*    (first two pins swapped) -- fixed below to ASIG5V DVDD DVSS VDD VSS so a plain ".include" of this
*    file lines up positionally with those instances. Internal nodes are name-based, so swapping only
*    the port names on the .SUBCKT line is sufficient.
*
* 2) Why use this (layout-capacitance-extracted) model instead of the raw PDK pad cell
*    (/foss/pdks/gf180mcuD/libs.ref/gf180mcu_fd_io/spice/gf180mcu_fd_io.spice): the raw PDK cell's
*    asig_5p0 subckt instantiates its MOS capacitor with a device multiplicity (m=36). Elaborating
*    that with ngspice-47 in this testbench deterministically aborts netlist load with a corrupted
*    internal line ("unknown parameter (e9)") while expanding the cap_nmos_06v0 compact model -- the
*    same ngspice/cap_nmos_06v0 "m=" elaboration bug already hit and worked around elsewhere this
*    project by manually expanding the multiplicity into individual same-size instances instead of
*    using "m=". extracted_gf180mcu_fd_io__asig_5p0_manually_scaled.spice already does exactly that
*    (36 unit 15um x 15um instances, no "m="), so it is reused here as-is (pin order fixed only).
***************************************************************************************************
* Magic Base Resolution (lambda) = 5nm (5e-9 m)
* Linear Scale Factor = 5e-9 m
* Area Scale Factor = (5e-9 m)^2 = 25e-18 m^2
***************************************************************************************************

.SUBCKT gf180mcu_fd_io__asig_5p0 ASIG5V DVDD DVSS VDD VSS

***************************************************************************************************
* --- Signal ESD Diodes (150 um^2) ---
***************************************************************************************************
D0 DVSS   ASIG5V diode_nd2ps_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12
D1 DVSS   ASIG5V diode_nd2ps_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12
D2 ASIG5V DVDD   diode_pd2nw_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12
D3 DVSS   ASIG5V diode_nd2ps_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12
D4 DVSS   ASIG5V diode_nd2ps_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12
D5 ASIG5V DVDD   diode_pd2nw_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12
D6 ASIG5V DVDD   diode_pd2nw_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12
D7 ASIG5V DVDD   diode_pd2nw_06v0 pj=106e-6 area=150e-12

***************************************************************************************************
* --- MOSCAPs (15 um x 15 um), instantiated individually (no "m=" multiplier) ---
***************************************************************************************************
X0  DVDD DVSS cap_nmos_06v0 c_width=15e-6 c_length=15e-6
X1  DVDD DVSS cap_nmos_06v0 c_width=15e-6 c_length=15e-6
X2  DVDD DVSS cap_nmos_06v0 c_width=15e-6 c_length=15e-6
